      <h1 style="margin-top:10px">How to run a badminton club night without spending the whole night running it</h1>
      <p class="lede">A good session is not one where the organiser makes brilliant decisions for two hours. It is one where ordinary decisions happen almost automatically and the organiser only has to notice the exceptions.</p>
      <div class="guide-meta">
        <span class="gm-tag">Guide</span>
